| GLM-5.3-Flash 3.0-bit (117.5 GB file) | D | Short chat, Decode, First run | 24.7 | 25.2 | 1.0x |
| GLM-5.3-Flash 3.0-bit (117.5 GB file) | D | Short chat, Dec

